awesome to hear Artemis Tosini (NixOS) ! i'm so glad that `NixBSD` is getting on board 🎉

you might consider using a `tmpfiles` implementation to replace `StateDirectory`, or a number of other simple possibilities of course

for `DynamicUser` you could simply us [gardenerdb](https://git.pinkro.se/Rose/gardenhouse/gardenerdb.git/), which is a from scratch implementation of the `systemd` userdb giving you very easy and simple access to dynamic users :)

