it'd maybe seem nicest if we didn't even need to say what path we should use, tho if some application seems hard-coded to it then... hm, what is even up with the process vs <name> here?
moreover, might hard-coding in uids not clash with like running multiple instances of the service in parallel as say a multi-tenant thing?

